quires that you integrate the live chat application into your Contoso University website in a way that is intuitive and  user-friendly.  A Person \"has a\" Address object (use composition for this). An Address object has a single property of type string for Email (for simplicity that's all an Address has)   A Student \"has a\" CreditsEarned property 10 pts: A Student \"has a\" Gpa property that can express overall grades with exactly 2 decimal points, such as 3.87, etc.  Use data attributes to insure that Email addresses entered into the system conform with the pattern [username]@contoso.edu. Hint: Refer to the regex material in the Galloway book.   Use data attributes to insure that Gpa is expressed as a value in range from 0.7 and 4.0 inclusive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":230109,"global_rank":109586},{"name":"RaymondJSu/sorting-visualizer","owner":"RaymondJSu","html_url":"https://github.com/RaymondJSu/sorting-visualizer","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":230106,"global_rank":109592},{"name":"cyyllam/psrc-notes","owner":"cyyllam","html_url":"https://github.com/cyyllam/psrc-notes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"A collection of work related notes","topics":[],"score":230106,"global_rank":109594},{"name":"sarahlynnx/Drum-Machine","owner":"sarahlynnx","html_url":"https://github.com/sarahlynnx/Drum-Machine","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Explore the Drum Machine, an interactive web app showcasing my front-end development skills. Built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, it features a responsive design, dynamic audio handling, and an engaging user interface for a fun drumming experience.","topics":[],"score":230106,"global_rank":109598},{"name":"raymond-devries/strava-unit-converter-e